@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title State L1：发送生命周期状态图
hide empty description

[*] --> VALIDATE

VALIDATE --> REJECTED : message/destination/options 非法
VALIDATE --> ENRICH : 校验通过

ENRICH --> REJECTED : enrich 失败 / messageId 生成失败
ENRICH --> RESOLVE : metadata/context 补齐成功

RESOLVE --> REJECTED : 路由不存在 / provider 未注册 / capability 不支持
RESOLVE --> SERIALIZE : provider + physical destination 已解析

SERIALIZE --> FAILED : payload 序列化失败
SERIALIZE --> SEND_READY : ProviderSendRequest 构建成功

SEND_READY --> DIRECT_SEND : reliability.send.enabled=false
SEND_READY --> RELIABLE_SEND : reliability.send.enabled=true

DIRECT_SEND --> CONFIRMED : ProviderSendResult.CONFIRMED
DIRECT_SEND --> FAILED : ProviderSendResult.FAILED
DIRECT_SEND --> REJECTED : ProviderSendResult.REJECTED
DIRECT_SEND --> UNKNOWN : ProviderSendResult.UNKNOWN / confirm timeout

RELIABLE_SEND --> CONFIRMED : RetryResult.SUCCESS
RELIABLE_SEND --> FAILED : EXHAUSTED / EXECUTION_FAILED / ABORTED
RELIABLE_SEND --> REJECTED : NOT_RETRYABLE + Provider REJECTED
RELIABLE_SEND --> UNKNOWN : Provider UNKNOWN / retry timeout / interrupted

CONFIRMED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
UNKNOWN --> [*]
@enduml
